  },
  "notebook_commit": "718f85c7ff20e35ab78764cd80e8a4f753dc1b34",
  "notebook_dirty": true,
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "NL04.1:body.s01",
      "type": "extension",
      "title": "是什么",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "$(a+bi)(c+di)=(ac-bd)+(ad+bc)i$，$\\left\\lvert z\\right\\rvert ^{2}=a^{2}+b^{2}$，\n$z^{-1}=\\overline{z}/\\left\\lvert z\\right\\rvert ^{2}$。"
    },
    {
      "id": "NL04.1:body.s02",
      "type": "extension",
      "title": "为什么需要",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "它是全库唯一的「非有序标量」：所有比较必须绕道 $\\mathrm{abs2}$（D7），\n所有正交必须用共轭转置（L3）。"
    },
    {
      "id": "NL04.1:body.s03",
      "type": "proof",
      "title": "关键结论",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "复数域**不存在**与加法乘法相容的全序。成立条件：无——\n这是定理（任何把 $\\mathbb{C}$ 变成有序域的尝试都会导致 $-1\\ge0$）。"
    },
    {
      "id": "NL04.1:body.s04",
      "type": "proof",
      "title": "判据",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "判复数相等必须逐分量比实虚两槽；$\\mathrm{abs2}$ 只能判模长（L5）。"
    },
    {
      "id": "NL04.1:body.s05",
      "type": "extension",
      "title": "前置",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "L4。"
    },
    {
      "id": "NL04.1:body.s06",
      "type": "extension",
      "title": "常见误解",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "以为「复数也能比大小，只是编译器不给」。不是编译器限制，是数学上不可能：\n只要 $\\left\\lvert \\cdot\\right\\rvert $ 与加减乘相容，$i^{2}=-1<0$ 必然矛盾。"
    }
  ],
